### Phase 15 — Account audit drill-down
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@providerProfileId = REPLACE_WITH_PROVIDER_PROFILE_ID
@patientProfileId = REPLACE_WITH_PATIENT_PROFILE_ID
@credentialDocumentId = REPLACE_WITH_PROVIDER_CREDENTIAL_DOCUMENT_ID

### Patient profile audit only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/audit?type=PATIENT&id={{patientProfileId}}&includeRelated=false&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Provider account lifecycle audit only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/audit?type=PROVIDER&id={{providerProfileId}}&includeRelated=false&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Provider account plus credential governance evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/audit?type=PROVIDER&id={{providerProfileId}}&includeRelated=true&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Specific credential document audit evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/audit?resource=provider_credential_document&resourceId={{credentialDocumentId}}&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter by action substring
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/audit?type=PROVIDER&id={{providerProfileId}}&includeRelated=true&action=credential&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
